WEBVTT

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:38.000
=Episode 11=

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:40.719
The garrison

00:01:40.719 --> 00:01:41.920
Runs on a strict hierarchy.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.400
Our husbands all have

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.760
Different ranks.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.640
So where military families live

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.680
Depends on rank too.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.599
Families of Banner Commanders

00:01:50.599 --> 00:01:52.319
And anyone below them

00:01:52.599 --> 00:01:53.519
Live right here,

00:01:53.799 --> 00:01:54.680
In Desheng Ward.

00:01:55.239 --> 00:01:56.239
But someday,

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.760
If your man

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.319
Gets promoted to company commander,

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:02.840
You can move into a three-courtyard brick house on South Street.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:04.439
And if

00:02:04.439 --> 00:02:06.000
He makes battalion commander,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.959
You can move near the Commander's Office,

00:02:07.959 --> 00:02:09.439
Into one of those grand carved mansions to the east.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:10.520
Even their thresholds

00:02:10.759 --> 00:02:12.879
Stand nine cun higher than ordinary homes.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:14.800
But for now,

00:02:15.039 --> 00:02:16.520
Your place

00:02:16.879 --> 00:02:17.639
Is right over there.

00:02:23.159 --> 00:02:24.120
Ma!

00:02:24.199 --> 00:02:24.960
Quit singing!

00:02:25.159 --> 00:02:26.599
You're killing my ears!

00:02:27.919 --> 00:02:28.599
So,

00:02:28.599 --> 00:02:30.919
Do we buy our own daily supplies,

00:02:30.919 --> 00:02:32.199
Or does the garrison provide them?

00:02:32.599 --> 00:02:33.560
That

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:34.840
Depends on rank too.

00:02:35.039 --> 00:02:36.000
Around here,

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.080
Money

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.800
Can't buy you everything.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:39.919
Sometimes,

00:02:39.919 --> 00:02:40.919
Even getting water

00:02:40.919 --> 00:02:42.439
Means waiting for your assigned time.

00:02:42.919 --> 00:02:43.919
And that's not even counting

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.360
My husband's rank.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.159
My younger brother

00:02:47.159 --> 00:02:48.319
Is an officer too.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.240
He's a deputy battalion commander.

00:02:50.599 --> 00:02:52.400
So we get special treatment in just about everything.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:52.800
Go.

00:02:53.599 --> 00:02:55.120
That's why I say, Miss Xie,

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.360
If a woman

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.719
Wants a good life,

00:02:58.599 --> 00:03:00.120
She still needs a man to rely on.

00:03:03.639 --> 00:03:05.479
The place is a little run-down,

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.840
But with some work,

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.159
We can make it feel like home.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.120
Well then,

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.199
I'll let you get settled.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.520
I won't keep you.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:28.520
Come catch me!

00:03:54.879 --> 00:03:56.199
I'll reach senior fifth rank as soon as I can,

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:58.560
And take everyone back to the capital.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:01.719
Of course I believe in you.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.160
Concubine Lu was the one

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.000
Who took your velvet flower in the first place.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.199
You were kind enough

00:04:20.199 --> 00:04:21.160
To save her from embarrassment,

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.160
And look what happened.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.519
Now you've offended Madam Mo.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:25.720
Who would've thought

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.759
A general's wife could be so petty,

00:04:27.759 --> 00:04:29.319
Putting someone on the spot like that?

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.720
Whatever's going on between his wife and concubine

00:04:30.879 --> 00:04:32.199
Is Mo's family business.

00:04:32.759 --> 00:04:34.519
Those two already had bad blood.

00:04:35.759 --> 00:04:36.759
They just dragged you into it.

00:04:36.839 --> 00:04:38.319
It's not like we went looking for trouble.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:39.240
From now on,

00:04:39.879 --> 00:04:40.839
Keep your distance from them.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.240
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

00:04:44.839 --> 00:04:46.279
People show their true colors with time.

00:04:46.879 --> 00:04:47.720
As for you,

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.839
Focus on your duties

00:04:49.839 --> 00:04:51.040
And get yourself established.

00:04:51.199 --> 00:04:53.920
I'll decide for myself

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:54.920
How to deal with the officers' wives.

00:04:56.079 --> 00:04:57.240
I trust you.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.240
But promise me

00:04:59.759 --> 00:05:01.000
You won't take unnecessary risks.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.560
I'll be at the barracks from now on.

00:05:04.839 --> 00:05:05.879
If anything happens,

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.000
Have Sen send word to me.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:13.480
Go on.

00:05:13.959 --> 00:05:14.879
We can handle

00:05:15.319 --> 00:05:16.160
The rest of this.

00:05:18.839 --> 00:05:19.720
All right.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.480
Ganlin may be a frontier town,

00:05:26.079 --> 00:05:27.160
But it's not exactly the front line.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.480
In the army,

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.639
If you want to move up,

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.399
You either rack up enough enemy kills

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.480
Or pull off something extraordinary.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.000
But you just got here.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:36.959
You're not going

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.360
To see combat anytime soon.

00:05:38.839 --> 00:05:40.199
Then how are we supposed to earn any merit?

00:05:42.279 --> 00:05:43.360
Camp rules say

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.720
They put up a red-ribbon target every month.

00:05:46.319 --> 00:05:47.879
Anyone who hits it is marked as outstanding

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.120
And gets first shot

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:49.720
At any chance to earn merit.

00:05:50.399 --> 00:05:51.839
Then why isn't everyone going for it?

00:05:52.879 --> 00:05:54.319
The other camps took theirs down ages ago.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.079
But here,

00:05:56.439 --> 00:05:57.600
Commander Lu missed his,

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:58.800
(Lu Dahu, Deputy Battalion Commander) so no one dares take it from him.

00:05:59.279 --> 00:06:00.319
Commander Lu?

00:06:00.399 --> 00:06:01.959
What's so special about him?

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.399
Nobody dares outdo him?

00:06:04.079 --> 00:06:05.439
General Mo didn't tell you?

00:06:05.959 --> 00:06:07.079
He's his brother-in-law

00:06:07.639 --> 00:06:08.879
And a deputy battalion commander.

00:06:10.399 --> 00:06:11.600
This bow's a piece of junk.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:15.759
There is a Concubine Lu.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:17.879
General Mo.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.519
General Mo!

00:06:21.319 --> 00:06:22.000
Yi!

00:06:26.639 --> 00:06:27.480
Zhao.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:30.759
General Mo.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:33.720
Here.

00:06:36.759 --> 00:06:37.600
Take it.

00:06:43.319 --> 00:06:44.319
I can't accept this.

00:06:44.439 --> 00:06:45.920
Why not?

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:47.519
This bow

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.079
Was meant for the man

00:06:49.079 --> 00:06:50.759
Who distinguished himself in the Yongning investigation.

00:06:50.839 --> 00:06:52.040
You've more than earned it.

00:06:52.319 --> 00:06:53.480
It'd be wrong

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.600
For me to keep it for myself.

00:06:55.079 --> 00:06:55.759
Trust me.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:56.519
Take it.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.199
Zhao,

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.480
Listen to me.

00:07:06.199 --> 00:07:07.240
Don't rush things.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:08.959
Compared with Shaqiong Town,

00:07:08.959 --> 00:07:10.639
We've got too many men chasing too few opportunities.

00:07:10.959 --> 00:07:11.920
But you've got

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.439
The Sixteenth Master's recommendation.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.360
Once you've earned some merit,

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.360
Commander Wang

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.240
Will surely consider you for promotion.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:23.920
Thank you for the advice, General Mo.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:24.720
All right.

00:07:24.959 --> 00:07:25.800
Go on. Try the bow.

00:07:31.319 --> 00:07:31.879
Look at that.

00:07:32.879 --> 00:07:34.040
That's a nice bow.

00:07:34.279 --> 00:07:36.240
Unbelievable.

00:07:36.759 --> 00:07:37.480
Let me try it.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.920
I even let my sister become his mistress,

00:07:40.879 --> 00:07:41.920
And he gives that bow to someone else?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:42.360
Mr. Zhao,

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.319
With a bow like this,

00:07:43.399 --> 00:07:44.439
You could hit anything at a hundred paces.

00:08:00.399 --> 00:08:01.120
Go back.

00:08:02.399 --> 00:08:03.240
Go.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:09.839
(Virtuous, Serene and Proper)

00:08:09.839 --> 00:08:10.720
You are dismissed.

00:08:12.639 --> 00:08:14.480
How is it still this hot this time of year?

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:15.680
It is strange.

00:08:16.639 --> 00:08:18.160
Well, if it isn't Madam Mo.

00:08:24.279 --> 00:08:25.959
Here to pick up your eldest daughter?

00:08:25.959 --> 00:08:26.759
That's right.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.360
I hear

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:30.120
There's a new young lady in town.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.080
How are you getting along?

00:08:34.399 --> 00:08:35.399
She's too good for the likes of me.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:37.320
Can't say I'm surprised.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.559
Just look at Miss Xie.

00:08:39.679 --> 00:08:40.840
Everything she eats and uses,

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:41.799
Everything she wears...

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:43.039
It's all so refined.

00:08:43.399 --> 00:08:45.000
She's not one of us.

00:08:45.559 --> 00:08:47.559
She probably sees us as country bumpkins.

00:08:47.559 --> 00:08:48.879
Why would she bother getting close to us?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.480
All she has to do is play a few tricks,

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:51.840
Get what she wants and walk away.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:53.879
If she keeps playing clever like this

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.440
And actually gets established in Ganlin,

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:57.919
The rest of us

00:08:58.039 --> 00:09:00.159
Will end up dancing to her tune.

00:09:03.919 --> 00:09:05.399
Just look at Concubine Lu.

00:09:06.039 --> 00:09:07.159
Before,

00:09:07.159 --> 00:09:08.360
Nobody could stand her.

00:09:08.519 --> 00:09:10.200
Now that she's got someone on her side,

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:11.919
She's suddenly

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.879
Walking around with her head held high.

00:09:26.039 --> 00:09:26.639
Miss Xie,

00:09:26.919 --> 00:09:28.799
The fields granted by the Sixteenth Master were taken.

00:09:30.759 --> 00:09:31.879
Taken it over?

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.399
We have the deed.

00:09:34.399 --> 00:09:35.879
The authorities only just granted us that land.

00:09:35.879 --> 00:09:37.120
How can someone just take it?

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.159
Is there no law around here?

00:09:38.279 --> 00:09:39.639
They don't care about deeds here.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:40.799
It's all women and children.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.600
They insist it was wasteland

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.840
And they've been farming it for years.

00:09:44.799 --> 00:09:45.799
I couldn't win the argument.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.200
I'll go.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:51.639
Sanniang.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:55.639
Then where did these bamboo slips come from?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.000
There are old battlefield graves from the previous dynasty on the land.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:58.960
They said

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.039
We could keep whatever they dug up.

00:10:01.919 --> 00:10:03.000
It's all worthless junk.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.279
They're doing this just to spite us.

00:10:04.679 --> 00:10:05.639
From graves?

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.000
That's bad luck.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.039
Exactly.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.680
(Mo Residence)

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.720
We're all brothers in arms.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.399
And now you've seized

00:10:41.639 --> 00:10:43.440
Banner Commander Zhao's fields.

00:10:43.559 --> 00:10:44.679
How can I face anyone

00:10:44.679 --> 00:10:45.679
In the military now?

00:10:45.799 --> 00:10:46.759
His fields?

00:10:46.879 --> 00:10:47.840
I reclaimed the wasteland!

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.519
That land sat abandoned for over ten years.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.600
The weeds were taller than a man.

00:10:52.799 --> 00:10:54.240
I took people out there myself

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.000
And cleared it little by little.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:57.399
We've got three children

00:10:57.679 --> 00:10:58.759
To provide for.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.320
Meanwhile, you get to stay out all day

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.519
And leave everything to me.

00:11:02.879 --> 00:11:04.360
You've never lifted a finger in the fields,

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.879
And you're still keeping another woman!

00:11:05.879 --> 00:11:06.639
Here we go again.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.759
Amazing.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.960
What respectable man these days

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.360
Doesn't have a few concubines and mistresses?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:12.759
What's the big deal?

00:11:16.919 --> 00:11:18.960
So that Lu woman isn't enough for you?

00:11:19.559 --> 00:11:20.879
You want another one?

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.039
Why don't you just

00:11:22.039 --> 00:11:22.919
Go after that Xie woman?

00:11:22.919 --> 00:11:23.240
You...

00:11:23.679 --> 00:11:25.600
She's even prettier than that Lu,

00:11:26.159 --> 00:11:27.000
And that figure of hers

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.759
Puts Lu's to shame!

00:11:28.919 --> 00:11:30.759
Go on, then! Go get her!

00:11:31.879 --> 00:11:33.440
Shameless!

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:35.200
Have you got no shame at all?

00:11:35.559 --> 00:11:37.679
Mo, you rotten scumbag!

00:11:37.679 --> 00:11:38.480
Just you dare go near her!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:39.639
I...

00:11:39.639 --> 00:11:40.679
I'll break her legs!

00:11:41.519 --> 00:11:42.559
Sorry about that, Miss Xie.

00:11:42.559 --> 00:11:44.800
(Mo Residence)

00:11:47.399 --> 00:11:49.240
Maybe we shouldn't go in.

00:11:58.399 --> 00:11:59.679
How was it with Madam Mo today?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:03.919
Didn't go very well.

00:12:04.799 --> 00:12:05.960
Madam Mo

00:12:06.159 --> 00:12:08.120
Is a complete shrew.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.559
The other military families

00:12:27.679 --> 00:12:29.480
Are afraid the land they're reassigned

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.159
Won't be as fertile as ours,

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.559
So they refuse to give it up.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.279
As for Madam Mo,

00:12:34.279 --> 00:12:35.519
She's still holding a grudge

00:12:35.519 --> 00:12:37.039
Over what happened when we first met

00:12:37.039 --> 00:12:37.919
And is giving me a hard time.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:42.919
I never meant to get dragged into the Mo family's domestic feud,

00:12:43.399 --> 00:12:44.480
Nor do I want to make enemies

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:46.000
Of the military families farming that land.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.440
But now,

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:49.759
I'm caught in the middle.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.159
If it's really that much trouble,

00:12:51.919 --> 00:12:52.679
Then maybe this land

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:53.960
Isn't worth fighting over.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:55.799
You can't reason with people

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.240
Who refuse to listen.

00:12:59.399 --> 00:13:01.279
If we can't even hold on to a piece of land,

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.360
How are we supposed

00:13:03.759 --> 00:13:04.960
To make a life here?

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:07.279
And then,

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.320
What will people think of you?

00:13:09.799 --> 00:13:11.000
Even in the army,

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.000
People may start looking down on you.

00:13:15.039 --> 00:13:16.120
So this land...

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.279
We're not giving it up.

00:13:19.519 --> 00:13:20.080
All right.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:22.600
If you want to fight for it,

00:13:23.559 --> 00:13:24.240
Then we'll fight for it.

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:26.919
These dates are good today.

00:13:26.919 --> 00:13:27.480
Yeah.

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.039
Big and plump.

00:13:28.039 --> 00:13:28.879
Come catch me!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:29.919
Biao.

00:13:30.399 --> 00:13:31.240
Did you hear?

00:13:31.799 --> 00:13:32.759
The authorities

00:13:32.759 --> 00:13:33.919
Need land for a cemetery.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.159
And they've chosen

00:13:35.159 --> 00:13:37.120
The plot that belongs to Miss Xie.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.200
Seriously?

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:38.840
It's true.

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:39.679
A cemetery?

00:13:39.679 --> 00:13:40.159
Yeah.

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:43.600
Isn't that the land we're farming?

00:13:45.279 --> 00:13:46.679
They did dig up

00:13:46.799 --> 00:13:48.639
Human bones there years ago.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.600
Makes sense they'd turn it into a cemetery.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.399
We need to tell Madam Mo right away.

00:13:52.399 --> 00:13:53.240
Yeah.

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:53.759
Well...

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.360
(Madam Mo, nee Zhou)

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.120
(Signed and sealed by Sun Zhen)

00:14:00.559 --> 00:14:01.600
Madam Mo,

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:04.559
Once the new deed is issued in a couple of days,

00:14:04.559 --> 00:14:06.440
Someone will deliver it to your residence.

00:14:06.759 --> 00:14:07.919
Thank you for the trouble.

00:14:08.159 --> 00:14:09.000
Of course.

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:10.679
My turn.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:13.080
(Contracting Party: Lin Sisheng) It should be filed in Xie's name.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.679
Well, that's strange.

00:14:14.679 --> 00:14:15.840
Usually,

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.320
You all fight

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.879
Over this land.

00:14:19.159 --> 00:14:19.960
Why are you

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.200
Giving it up so easily today?

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:22.799
Surely you jest, My Lord.

00:14:23.159 --> 00:14:25.519
If the authorities need that land for a cemetery,

00:14:25.639 --> 00:14:26.879
Then as military families,

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.399
Of course we'll cooperate.

00:14:28.799 --> 00:14:29.759
A cemetery?

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:31.519
Where did you hear that?

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:33.559
My Lord,

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.679
We heard just a few days ago

00:14:35.679 --> 00:14:37.960
That Miss Xie's land was being taken for a cemetery.

00:14:38.679 --> 00:14:39.720
That's not true.

00:14:39.799 --> 00:14:41.480
Now that the deeds have been corrected,

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:42.679
The matter is settled.

00:14:42.679 --> 00:14:43.679
From now on,

00:14:43.879 --> 00:14:45.320
You tend your own fields,

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.480
And Miss Xie tends hers.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.799
Let's have no more pointless disputes.

00:14:48.799 --> 00:14:50.399
She tricked us.

00:14:50.679 --> 00:14:51.960
Now we're the ones who lose out.

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.080
Exactly.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:57.560
(One Month Later)

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:12.360
Miss Xie.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:13.679
Mr. Zhao's back!

00:15:30.679 --> 00:15:31.320
Mr. Zhao.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:32.840
It's been so long since you've been home.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.120
I just came back for some clothes.

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:48.080
Here.

00:16:21.919 --> 00:16:23.080
It's a long trip.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.759
You don't have to come all this way every time.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:26.639
Sen

00:16:27.039 --> 00:16:28.360
Is at an age when he needs some guidance.

00:16:29.399 --> 00:16:30.200
I just

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.960
Came back to check on him.

00:16:32.759 --> 00:16:33.240
I'm off.

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:34.879
Be careful on the way back.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:48.679
What...

00:16:49.399 --> 00:16:50.600
What happened?

00:16:51.159 --> 00:16:52.840
The horse stepped on a caltrop.

00:16:52.919 --> 00:16:53.679
Its hoof is injured.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.559
It won't be fit to ride tonight.

00:17:02.679 --> 00:17:03.320
Sanniang,

00:17:04.039 --> 00:17:04.880
Have Zheng San

00:17:05.079 --> 00:17:06.079
Take the horse and tend to it.

00:17:06.079 --> 00:17:06.720
Okay.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:07.279
Go.

00:17:10.079 --> 00:17:11.160
What about you, Mr. Zhao?

00:17:12.839 --> 00:17:14.160
I'm not on leave today.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.640
I have to get back to camp.

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:17.440
But don't worry.

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:18.240
These past few days,

00:17:18.359 --> 00:17:19.680
I've learned the terrain.

00:17:20.279 --> 00:17:21.119
Traveling at night

00:17:21.759 --> 00:17:22.519
Won't be a problem.

00:17:23.759 --> 00:17:25.279
At this hour?

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:26.960
Out in the wilderness?

00:17:27.519 --> 00:17:28.799
What if you run into

00:17:28.799 --> 00:17:30.240
Wild beasts out there?

00:17:30.359 --> 00:17:31.400
It's too dangerous.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.440
Life on the frontier is different.

00:17:35.799 --> 00:17:36.960
Some rules

00:17:37.079 --> 00:17:38.519
Don't have to be followed to the letter.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:40.960
Your horse is injured,

00:17:41.519 --> 00:17:43.240
And you don't have another mount.

00:17:43.519 --> 00:17:44.480
We can't have you

00:17:44.559 --> 00:17:46.720
Walking all night just to get back to camp.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.079
Tomorrow morning,

00:17:50.079 --> 00:17:51.160
I'll have Zheng San

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:53.880
Find you a fast horse, and you can ride back then.

00:17:55.519 --> 00:17:57.839
Stay in the east room tonight, Mr. Zhao.

00:17:58.799 --> 00:18:00.680
That room was meant for you anyway.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.920
Bring the horse inside,

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.200
And no one will know you stayed the night.

00:18:23.559 --> 00:18:25.039
If you stay out here

00:18:25.039 --> 00:18:26.359
Any longer,

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.759
Everyone will find out.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:46.319
It's your house

00:18:46.319 --> 00:18:47.359
And your room.

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.160
Why do you have to hide the fact you're staying here?

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.079
Miss Xie and I aren't married yet.

00:18:51.519 --> 00:18:52.759
Living under the same roof

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:53.759
Wouldn't be proper.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.640
Her reputation is at stake.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:58.640
So don't let

00:18:59.039 --> 00:18:59.920
Anyone know about this.

00:19:00.759 --> 00:19:01.359
Put that away.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:39.760
♪The past brushes by like a falling leaf♪

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:48.480
♪So light, yet my steps still pause for you♪

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:54.440
♪Through every rise and fall, our memories remain without regret♪

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:57.320
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:58.960
Get some rest.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.600
♪But I can't♪

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:09.000
You too.

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:14.080
♪Fill my eyes with tears♪

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:20.560
♪Etched deep within my heart, yet buried without a word♪

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:25.600
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:30.160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:35.480
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:42.119
Commander.

00:20:43.079 --> 00:20:44.240
At last night's roll call,

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.880
Excluding those with night passes,

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:46.640
Three men were absent.

00:20:47.559 --> 00:20:48.440
Banner Commander Li

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:49.400
Went home to help with the farm

00:20:49.599 --> 00:20:50.599
And returned before midnight.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:51.880
Banner Commander Sun

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:52.759
Left because his mother fell seriously ill

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:53.920
Without requesting a pass.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:55.839
I'll give you a demerit for now.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.160
You can make up for it

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:58.400
With merit in the future.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.079
Thank you, sir.

00:20:59.079 --> 00:21:00.720
Hurry! Where have you been?

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.119
Lu Dahu pulled a dirty trick last night.

00:21:02.119 --> 00:21:02.720
He saw you were gone

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.200
And called a surprise roll call.

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.480
But don't worry.

00:21:05.839 --> 00:21:07.119
Just tell them

00:21:07.119 --> 00:21:08.759
You stayed at Miss Xie's place last night.

00:21:08.759 --> 00:21:09.839
We're not at war.

00:21:09.839 --> 00:21:11.519
At worst, Commander Wang will chew you out,

00:21:11.519 --> 00:21:12.559
And that'll be the end of it.

00:21:14.279 --> 00:21:15.039
No.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.440
Miss Xie and I aren't married yet.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.839
If I admit I spent the night there,

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:21.480
What happens to her reputation?

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.720
Bout the third man?

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.480
Banner Commander Zhao

00:21:27.039 --> 00:21:29.119
Didn't return until this morning.

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:36.039
Zhao Ling.

00:21:36.279 --> 00:21:38.160
Where were you last night?

00:21:43.839 --> 00:21:45.200
I got drunk at a tavern east of town

00:21:46.319 --> 00:21:47.039
And overslept.

00:21:50.079 --> 00:21:51.119
Banner Commander Zhao,

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:53.000
You were absent without leave,

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:54.960
Abandoning your post.

00:21:55.799 --> 00:21:56.880
By military law,

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:58.759
That's eighty strokes

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:01.039
And three months' pay docked.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:02.960
Banner Commander Zhao,

00:22:03.319 --> 00:22:05.000
You only spent the night at home.

00:22:05.319 --> 00:22:07.200
Why not just say family matters made you miss roll call?

00:22:07.319 --> 00:22:08.960
Once you and Miss Xie are married,

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:09.680
You'll be living together anyway.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:10.680
I left camp without permission,

00:22:11.839 --> 00:22:12.799
Got drunk and missed duty.

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:14.799
I'll take the punishment.

00:22:15.839 --> 00:22:16.640
Fine.

00:22:17.079 --> 00:22:17.799
Zhao Ling,

00:22:19.039 --> 00:22:21.519
You talk about keeping your head high

00:22:21.519 --> 00:22:23.119
And your feet on the ground.

00:22:23.599 --> 00:22:25.680
You have no regard for military law

00:22:25.759 --> 00:22:26.880
And you're utterly arrogant!

00:22:27.799 --> 00:22:28.799
Without severe punishment,

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:30.519
How can discipline be maintained?

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:32.640
Guards!

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:35.720
Eighty strokes.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.400
Not one less.

00:22:38.599 --> 00:22:39.319
Commander!

00:22:40.359 --> 00:22:40.960
I'll

00:22:41.319 --> 00:22:42.440
Take twenty strokes

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:43.519
For Banner Commander Zhao.

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:44.799
I'll take twenty too.

00:22:45.039 --> 00:22:45.960
So will I.

00:22:46.559 --> 00:22:47.599
Very well.

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:48.720
If that's what you want,

00:22:49.079 --> 00:22:50.359
I'll grant it.

00:22:55.079 --> 00:22:55.920
Thank you.

00:22:57.359 --> 00:22:58.000
Strike!

00:22:58.720 --> 00:22:59.359
Yes, sir.

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:05.319
Picking dates all day

00:23:05.319 --> 00:23:06.839
Nearly broke my back.

00:23:06.839 --> 00:23:07.279
Tell me about it.

00:23:13.319 --> 00:23:14.400
How are you, Mr. Zhao?

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:16.039
It's nothing.

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:17.519
I've had much worse.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:29.039
Mr. Zhao.

00:23:29.039 --> 00:23:29.480
What...?

00:23:33.279 --> 00:23:33.920
Well,

00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:35.599
As soon as Miss Xie heard what happened,

00:23:35.599 --> 00:23:36.920
She was worried sick.

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:38.000
She had all this medicine

00:23:38.079 --> 00:23:39.119
Prepared for you.

00:23:42.319 --> 00:23:43.240
I'm fine.

00:23:44.319 --> 00:23:45.240
Sorry I worried you.

00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:48.079
Is it bad?

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:50.440
Don't cause any problems later.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:23:59.880
Does it hurt?

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.400
The salve at camp isn't very good,

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:04.480
And it's been freezing.

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:06.039
I think I got frostbite.

00:24:07.720 --> 00:24:08.279
Oh...

00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:09.160
Sanniang,

00:24:09.359 --> 00:24:09.920
Quick.

00:24:10.039 --> 00:24:11.319
Take this wound salve

00:24:11.319 --> 00:24:12.279
And give some to the others.

00:24:12.359 --> 00:24:12.920
Sure.

00:24:18.279 --> 00:24:19.599
Mr. Zhao, your injury...

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:21.960
Let me take a look.

00:24:23.799 --> 00:24:25.160
This might hurt a little.

00:24:32.039 --> 00:24:32.839
I'll be gentle.

00:24:39.920 --> 00:24:40.359
I...

00:24:40.680 --> 00:24:41.160
I'll...

00:24:43.279 --> 00:24:44.359
I'll be even gentler.

00:24:44.359 --> 00:24:46.359
Didn't we all get twenty strokes?

00:24:47.680 --> 00:24:48.400
Was the one

00:24:48.519 --> 00:24:49.720
Who struck Mr. Zhao

00:24:49.720 --> 00:24:51.039
Particularly heavy-handed?

00:24:52.240 --> 00:24:53.680
Still, that couldn't have been worse

00:24:54.200 --> 00:24:55.640
Than the beatings he used to get

00:24:55.640 --> 00:24:57.440
For selling salt, could it?

00:24:58.680 --> 00:24:59.880
I...I'll be gentle!

00:24:59.880 --> 00:25:00.720
Ow!

00:25:01.240 --> 00:25:02.160
You little rascal.

00:25:02.160 --> 00:25:03.119
You shouldn't be looking at this.

00:25:03.119 --> 00:25:03.440
Go.

00:25:03.960 --> 00:25:04.400
Get out.

00:25:05.319 --> 00:25:06.039
You're killing me.

00:25:07.440 --> 00:25:08.400
No.

00:25:29.720 --> 00:25:30.398
I...

00:25:30.398 --> 00:25:30.599
I...

00:25:30.599 --> 00:25:31.160
It's dirty now.

00:25:32.759 --> 00:25:33.920
I'll keep it.

00:25:35.960 --> 00:25:37.799
I'll make you a new one.

00:25:37.799 --> 00:25:38.200
I...

00:25:39.079 --> 00:25:39.720
Can you check

00:25:39.720 --> 00:25:40.599
If maybe

00:25:40.599 --> 00:25:41.759
My spine's broken?

00:26:04.000 --> 00:26:05.559
Don't mind me. I'm just making a fuss.

00:26:05.759 --> 00:26:06.160
It

00:26:06.240 --> 00:26:07.319
Doesn't hurt at all.

00:26:13.480 --> 00:26:15.160
My grandmother used to tell me

00:26:16.079 --> 00:26:17.680
The inner household was just like the court.

00:26:18.799 --> 00:26:20.240
If you want people to respect you,

00:26:20.720 --> 00:26:21.920
You have to establish your authority first.

00:26:24.160 --> 00:26:25.240
So I thought

00:26:26.440 --> 00:26:28.000
When we came to Ganlin,

00:26:28.359 --> 00:26:30.119
The first thing we needed to show everyone

00:26:30.640 --> 00:26:32.079
Was that we weren't to be pushed around.

00:26:32.559 --> 00:26:33.799
But I was wrong.

00:26:34.559 --> 00:26:36.079
Instead of backing off,

00:26:36.960 --> 00:26:38.480
They only got worse.

00:26:40.799 --> 00:26:42.240
And you got hurt because of it.

00:26:43.880 --> 00:26:45.160
That's on me.

00:26:45.799 --> 00:26:46.920
Don't think like that.

00:26:49.599 --> 00:26:50.240
I had a hand

00:26:50.960 --> 00:26:52.119
In the plan too.

00:26:53.240 --> 00:26:54.599
You grew up in an official's household.

00:26:55.359 --> 00:26:56.240
Of course you're not used to

00:26:56.240 --> 00:26:57.880
Dealing with country folk like them.

00:26:59.480 --> 00:27:00.400
But when it comes to

00:27:01.039 --> 00:27:02.559
Dealing with women like Madam Yan,

00:27:03.279 --> 00:27:04.799
No one does it better than you.

00:27:07.599 --> 00:27:08.759
Now that we're in Ganlin,

00:27:09.559 --> 00:27:10.279
And have to deal

00:27:10.720 --> 00:27:12.079
With people like Madam Mo,

00:27:13.920 --> 00:27:15.160
You've still got me.

00:27:17.839 --> 00:27:19.640
Then I'll be counting on you.

00:27:20.559 --> 00:27:21.519
There are two ways.

00:27:22.160 --> 00:27:22.960
First,

00:27:23.519 --> 00:27:24.720
You use your connections.

00:27:25.400 --> 00:27:26.519
Show them the Crown Prince's card.

00:27:27.839 --> 00:27:29.400
With the Sixteenth Master's name behind you,

00:27:29.839 --> 00:27:32.319
The leaders' wives, the generals' wives,

00:27:33.359 --> 00:27:35.319
Even Madam Wang and Madam Mo,

00:27:35.880 --> 00:27:37.640
Won't dare push you around openly.

00:27:38.200 --> 00:27:39.440
But if I do that,

00:27:40.039 --> 00:27:41.359
Then I've already lost.

00:27:43.920 --> 00:27:45.279
Then there's only the second way.

00:27:46.799 --> 00:27:47.799
You'll have to

00:27:49.119 --> 00:27:50.599
Get closer to them.

00:27:53.119 --> 00:27:54.519
(Don't let them think)

00:27:54.839 --> 00:27:55.960
(you're above them.)

00:27:57.559 --> 00:27:58.880
(You have to come down to their level)

00:27:59.160 --> 00:28:00.400
(and get your hands dirty.)

00:28:00.759 --> 00:28:01.880
(Let them see)

00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:03.279
(that you're just like them...)

00:28:03.680 --> 00:28:05.519
(someone who eats the same food)

00:28:05.920 --> 00:28:07.240
(and feels the same joys and sorrows.)

00:28:07.880 --> 00:28:08.759
Has the Zhao household

00:28:09.000 --> 00:28:10.400
Become a kitchen all of a sudden?

00:28:10.960 --> 00:28:12.680
She's a pampered young lady.

00:28:12.680 --> 00:28:14.519
To her, this is probably just playing house.

00:28:18.039 --> 00:28:18.680
It's burnt!

00:28:18.839 --> 00:28:19.359
Miss Xie!

00:28:21.440 --> 00:28:27.120
♪Once a bird in a cage, longing for the boundless sky♪

00:28:27.880 --> 00:28:28.319
It's going to rain!

00:28:28.319 --> 00:28:29.240
Miss Xie, it's going to rain.

00:28:29.240 --> 00:28:29.799
Quick!

00:28:29.799 --> 00:28:30.759
Get the grain inside!

00:28:30.759 --> 00:28:31.200
Hurry!

00:28:31.319 --> 00:28:32.079
Grab the sacks!

00:28:32.720 --> 00:28:33.200
Hurry.

00:28:33.559 --> 00:28:34.000
Hurry.

00:28:35.240 --> 00:28:36.000
Miss Xie.

00:28:36.119 --> 00:28:37.119
Hurry, bring it in!

00:28:37.119 --> 00:28:37.599
Quick!

00:28:37.599 --> 00:28:38.680
Bring two more sacks.

00:28:40.720 --> 00:28:41.759
It's not even your grain.

00:28:41.759 --> 00:28:42.440
Why are you in such a rush?

00:28:42.440 --> 00:28:43.640
Just keep packing!

00:28:44.200 --> 00:28:45.480
I'm helping you, aren't I?

00:28:45.920 --> 00:28:46.759
Get it in the sacks!

00:28:47.320 --> 00:28:50.880
♪Once a bird among the clouds, now fallen into the mortal world♪

00:28:50.880 --> 00:28:51.480
Hurry.

00:28:51.480 --> 00:28:52.359
Everyone, go help.

00:28:52.640 --> 00:28:52.960
Got it!

00:28:52.960 --> 00:28:53.839
Okay.

00:28:54.599 --> 00:28:56.000
Bring another sack over here.

00:28:57.640 --> 00:28:58.039
Miss Xie.

00:28:58.039 --> 00:28:58.319
Hey...

00:28:58.720 --> 00:28:59.240
Miss Xie.

00:28:59.640 --> 00:29:00.160
Miss Xie.

00:29:00.519 --> 00:29:01.119
Are you okay, Miss Xie?

00:29:01.119 --> 00:29:01.480
Quick.

00:29:01.480 --> 00:29:02.640
Take this over there.

00:29:03.200 --> 00:29:03.839
Take this one.

00:29:04.799 --> 00:29:05.240
Hurry.

00:29:05.319 --> 00:29:06.079
Everyone, move.

00:29:06.200 --> 00:29:07.000
Pick up the pace.

00:29:07.720 --> 00:29:08.400
Bag this up.

00:29:09.680 --> 00:29:11.480
♪Every light safe and warm♪

00:29:12.680 --> 00:29:13.559
You okay?

00:29:13.559 --> 00:29:14.119
I'm fine.

00:29:14.600 --> 00:29:18.160
♪A life adrift♪

00:29:19.120 --> 00:29:22.880
♪With wit and strategy, I enter this game without regret♪

00:29:22.880 --> 00:29:23.720
I'm done over here.

00:29:25.040 --> 00:29:28.040
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

00:29:30.160 --> 00:29:31.440
The soldiers are here!

00:29:31.519 --> 00:29:32.759
The soldiers are here!

00:29:32.759 --> 00:29:37.960
♪I seek no mercy lent by mortal world♪

00:29:39.160 --> 00:29:43.360
♪Mortal world♪

00:29:44.920 --> 00:29:50.360
♪Let this fleeting world carry me through a life adrift♪

00:29:53.000 --> 00:29:53.640
Come on, hurry!

00:29:53.640 --> 00:29:54.240
Help bring it in!

00:29:54.480 --> 00:29:54.880
Got it!

00:29:56.960 --> 00:29:59.920
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

00:30:00.839 --> 00:30:02.480
This rain's ridiculous.

00:30:02.759 --> 00:30:03.799
It starts out of nowhere

00:30:03.799 --> 00:30:04.839
And stops just as fast.

00:30:07.039 --> 00:30:07.799
Hurry.

00:30:08.119 --> 00:30:08.759
Coming!

00:30:14.680 --> 00:30:15.079
All right.

00:30:16.960 --> 00:30:17.559
Give it to me.

00:30:17.559 --> 00:30:18.680
Careful not to spill any.

00:30:18.920 --> 00:30:19.359
Here.

00:30:21.759 --> 00:30:22.519
I didn't expect

00:30:22.720 --> 00:30:23.920
You to know how to do this.

00:30:24.240 --> 00:30:25.559
I was once a refugee.

00:30:26.400 --> 00:30:27.839
I've seen people displaced from their homes

00:30:28.200 --> 00:30:29.599
Fight just to eat and stay clothed.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:30.799
So I know

00:30:31.599 --> 00:30:32.759
How precious a full stomach

00:30:33.079 --> 00:30:34.480
And warm clothes

00:30:34.599 --> 00:30:35.599
Can be.

00:30:39.799 --> 00:30:41.279
I was too petty before.

00:30:41.359 --> 00:30:42.519
Because of me, your man

00:30:42.519 --> 00:30:43.480
Ended up taking those strokes.

00:30:46.000 --> 00:30:46.440
Here.

00:30:46.440 --> 00:30:47.079
Let me help.

00:30:50.079 --> 00:30:51.160
Don't take this the wrong way,

00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:52.720
But around here,

00:30:52.799 --> 00:30:54.160
There's a female instructor named Zuo.

00:30:54.400 --> 00:30:55.599
Don't get on her bad side.

00:30:56.480 --> 00:30:57.519
People around here

00:30:57.720 --> 00:30:58.920
Think very highly of her.

00:30:59.519 --> 00:31:00.880
One bad word from her

00:31:00.960 --> 00:31:02.240
Carries more weight than ten other people's.

00:31:05.000 --> 00:31:05.880
Madam Mo,

00:31:06.440 --> 00:31:07.480
We've got everything packed up.

00:31:07.480 --> 00:31:08.880
We're all done here too.

00:31:08.880 --> 00:31:10.160
Wonderful. That was quick.

00:31:11.759 --> 00:31:12.920
Miss Xie,

00:31:13.680 --> 00:31:14.599
Thank you.

00:31:22.120 --> 00:31:22.920
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

00:31:22.920 --> 00:31:23.759
My Lord,

00:31:24.440 --> 00:31:25.720
A little higher.

00:31:26.400 --> 00:31:27.640
One cun up.

00:31:28.839 --> 00:31:29.920
One cun up.

00:31:37.839 --> 00:31:40.240
So this is the bearing of a junior fourth-rank official.

00:31:40.960 --> 00:31:42.960
Every bit as lean and striking as they say.

00:31:43.799 --> 00:31:45.319
No wonder

00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:47.680
You know just what to say to please a man.

00:31:48.119 --> 00:31:50.359
Compared with the women back home,

00:31:50.440 --> 00:31:51.839
You're far more entertaining.

00:31:54.160 --> 00:31:55.799
All these years as a widow...

00:31:56.759 --> 00:31:58.759
All those lonely nights

00:31:59.039 --> 00:32:00.920
Have only made you

00:32:01.480 --> 00:32:02.880
More captivating.

00:32:03.559 --> 00:32:04.519
You only

00:32:04.519 --> 00:32:07.000
Get better with age.

00:32:12.720 --> 00:32:14.240
All you care about is having your fun.

00:32:14.359 --> 00:32:15.799
You don't care what happens to me.

00:32:18.839 --> 00:32:20.079
My dear,

00:32:20.079 --> 00:32:22.039
Who in all of Ganlin

00:32:22.519 --> 00:32:25.200
Would dare threaten your life?

00:32:25.200 --> 00:32:26.680
What if

00:32:27.440 --> 00:32:29.839
I'm after someone else's?

00:32:34.440 --> 00:32:35.200
I'll go change the water.

00:32:35.200 --> 00:32:35.599
All right.

00:32:38.680 --> 00:32:39.440
Mr. Zhao,

00:32:39.839 --> 00:32:41.079
You're still injured.

00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:42.279
Why not wash up and change

00:32:42.279 --> 00:32:42.680
Your dressing

00:32:42.680 --> 00:32:43.599
Before heading back to camp?

00:32:46.160 --> 00:32:47.640
I'll have Sanniang bring you some clean water.

00:32:47.640 --> 00:32:48.240
No need.

00:32:48.799 --> 00:32:49.720
Clean water is precious out here.

00:32:49.839 --> 00:32:50.920
I'll just use the water you already used.

00:32:53.960 --> 00:32:55.039
(He's actually using)

00:32:55.039 --> 00:32:56.839
(my handkerchief and the water I just used.)

00:33:16.799 --> 00:33:18.039
Look at you.

00:33:19.039 --> 00:33:20.640
You've already won them over.

00:33:23.880 --> 00:33:25.920
I have a good teacher.

00:33:26.480 --> 00:33:27.359
But

00:33:27.920 --> 00:33:29.480
After all this,

00:33:30.440 --> 00:33:32.039
I've been thinking of something else.

00:33:33.680 --> 00:33:34.440
Let's hear it.

00:33:39.119 --> 00:33:40.200
What if...

00:33:43.440 --> 00:33:44.759
You and I

00:33:44.759 --> 00:33:45.559
Got married here in Ganlin?

00:33:50.000 --> 00:33:51.079
Once we're married,

00:33:51.400 --> 00:33:52.240
You can

00:33:52.240 --> 00:33:53.400
Move back home

00:33:53.400 --> 00:33:54.519
Without having to hide it.

00:33:55.079 --> 00:33:56.480
The gossip

00:33:56.480 --> 00:33:57.680
Will die down too.

00:33:58.480 --> 00:34:00.640
No one could use it against you anymore.

00:34:01.480 --> 00:34:02.880
It would also help

00:34:02.880 --> 00:34:03.839
Your career in the army.

00:34:07.880 --> 00:34:09.480
I may not be very good at it,

00:34:10.360 --> 00:34:11.199
But

00:34:12.280 --> 00:34:13.840
I can learn

00:34:14.000 --> 00:34:15.880
To be like the other military wives

00:34:17.440 --> 00:34:18.280
And make you

00:34:18.280 --> 00:34:20.079
Clothes for every season.

00:34:20.960 --> 00:34:22.519
Whenever you come home on leave,

00:34:22.920 --> 00:34:24.360
There'll always be

00:34:24.360 --> 00:34:25.880
A hot meal waiting for you.

00:34:28.639 --> 00:34:29.840
I think

00:34:30.280 --> 00:34:31.280
An arrangement like this

00:34:31.599 --> 00:34:32.880
Would make things easier for both of us.

00:34:35.719 --> 00:34:37.000
So it's just about convenience?

00:34:54.079 --> 00:34:55.119
Did you burn your hand?

00:35:03.039 --> 00:35:04.280
The water's cold.

00:35:15.079 --> 00:35:16.519
Why are you angry?

00:35:19.880 --> 00:35:21.360
I'm not exactly angry.

00:35:23.280 --> 00:35:24.760
I guess I just...

00:35:26.840 --> 00:35:28.039
Read too much into things.

00:35:30.199 --> 00:35:31.880
We've come this far together.

00:35:33.119 --> 00:35:34.679
I don't want there to be

00:35:34.800 --> 00:35:36.000
Anything between us.

00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:38.280
If something's bothering you, just say it.

00:35:38.599 --> 00:35:39.599
Don't hide it from me.

00:35:45.400 --> 00:35:47.800
Some things just aren't that easy to tell you.

00:35:51.880 --> 00:35:52.800
You're very clever,

00:35:54.119 --> 00:35:55.320
But you don't have to

00:35:55.719 --> 00:35:56.760
Understand everything.

00:35:59.480 --> 00:36:01.480
Your grandmother never taught you this?

00:36:02.400 --> 00:36:04.320
But if you teach me,

00:36:05.280 --> 00:36:06.719
Maybe I would understand.

00:36:11.760 --> 00:36:13.800
We agreed to walk this road together,

00:36:14.280 --> 00:36:15.639
And you've stayed by my side

00:36:16.039 --> 00:36:17.119
Through all this hardship.

00:36:18.679 --> 00:36:19.880
But somehow,

00:36:22.039 --> 00:36:23.159
I still feel so far from you.

00:36:28.239 --> 00:36:30.320
That's exactly why I think

00:36:30.960 --> 00:36:32.519
We should get married.

00:36:38.639 --> 00:36:39.800
I have roll call at camp.

00:36:40.760 --> 00:36:41.599
I should get back.

00:36:48.920 --> 00:36:49.559
Mr. Zhao,

00:36:49.880 --> 00:36:51.239
Didn't you say

00:36:51.239 --> 00:36:52.280
You wanted to marry Miss Xie?

00:36:53.360 --> 00:36:54.199
Now

00:36:54.199 --> 00:36:55.320
She's the one asking you,

00:36:55.920 --> 00:36:57.199
So why are you upset?

00:36:59.599 --> 00:37:00.639
She talked about

00:37:01.800 --> 00:37:03.320
The convenience of being a military wife,

00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:05.400
My career,

00:37:06.599 --> 00:37:08.400
And our whole life together.

00:37:09.679 --> 00:37:10.679
But the one thing she never said

00:37:14.360 --> 00:37:16.159
Was that she loved me.

00:37:19.719 --> 00:37:20.599
I want

00:37:22.280 --> 00:37:23.960
A marriage built on love,

00:37:26.000 --> 00:37:27.480
Not one based on mutual gain.

00:37:29.079 --> 00:37:29.679
I'm off.

00:37:30.239 --> 00:37:31.159
Be careful.

00:37:31.800 --> 00:37:34.800
(The Capital)

00:37:35.280 --> 00:37:37.280
(Yu Residence)

00:37:37.920 --> 00:37:39.920
This embroidery is exquisite.

00:37:40.960 --> 00:37:41.960
Miss Mozhan,

00:37:42.159 --> 00:37:43.360
Not long ago,

00:37:43.440 --> 00:37:44.960
My daughter-in-law had a baby girl.

00:37:45.360 --> 00:37:46.719
I'd like to ask you

00:37:46.719 --> 00:37:47.800
To make me

00:37:47.800 --> 00:37:50.079
A small double-sided embroidered screen with orchids and osmanthus.

00:37:50.079 --> 00:37:51.039
Your embroidery

00:37:51.039 --> 00:37:52.960
Comes from the Fu family tradition in Huaying.

00:37:52.960 --> 00:37:54.480
There is none finer.

00:37:54.880 --> 00:37:56.079
I only wonder

00:37:56.199 --> 00:37:58.000
If you'd be willing to do me this favor.

00:37:58.119 --> 00:37:59.400
You're too kind, Ms. Shu.

00:37:59.679 --> 00:38:01.079
I'd be happy to help.

00:38:01.079 --> 00:38:02.599
All social dealings of this household

00:38:02.599 --> 00:38:04.079
Are handled through the common purse.

00:38:04.760 --> 00:38:05.880
Proper procedures

00:38:05.880 --> 00:38:06.880
Must be followed.

00:38:07.440 --> 00:38:08.559
Yet you, Ms. Shu,

00:38:09.039 --> 00:38:10.320
Went around the steward

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:12.360
And privately assigned one of my maids.

00:38:12.960 --> 00:38:14.199
That's hardly proper, is it?

00:38:14.920 --> 00:38:15.760
Young Madam,

00:38:15.960 --> 00:38:16.440
I...

00:38:16.519 --> 00:38:18.360
I only asked for my own sake.

00:38:18.480 --> 00:38:20.559
Miss Mozhan's embroidery is so fine.

00:38:21.000 --> 00:38:22.639
I thought I'd ask her for a small favor.

00:38:23.360 --> 00:38:24.679
I didn't want to trouble the household,

00:38:25.199 --> 00:38:27.000
Much less bother you, Young Madam.

00:38:27.480 --> 00:38:29.079
You've served this family for decades.

00:38:29.239 --> 00:38:30.559
Surely you know the rules better than I do.

00:38:33.159 --> 00:38:35.719
Double-sided embroidery demands absolute precision.

00:38:36.119 --> 00:38:37.199
Even after a hundred days' work,

00:38:37.199 --> 00:38:39.079
You may not produce a truly fine piece.

00:38:39.760 --> 00:38:41.280
Mozhan serves in my quarters.

00:38:41.519 --> 00:38:43.159
She already has work to do for me.

00:38:43.400 --> 00:38:45.599
If she gets distracted helping with your little favor,

00:38:46.119 --> 00:38:47.719
Delaying my own needlework is one thing.

00:38:48.440 --> 00:38:50.039
But if her work turns out poorly

00:38:50.440 --> 00:38:52.320
And embarrasses the Yu family,

00:38:52.840 --> 00:38:53.800
Can she

00:38:54.000 --> 00:38:55.239
Take responsibility for that?

00:38:56.119 --> 00:38:57.239
I understand.

00:39:01.199 --> 00:39:03.320
Madam, you needn't do this for my sake.

00:39:03.559 --> 00:39:06.119
I did put my own wishes first

00:39:06.480 --> 00:39:08.079
And broke the household rules.

00:39:10.000 --> 00:39:11.280
Who made those rules?

00:39:12.079 --> 00:39:13.760
If she dares humiliate you today,

00:39:14.960 --> 00:39:17.000
Then she clearly has no respect for me.

00:39:24.720 --> 00:39:27.120
(Next Episode)

00:39:27.559 --> 00:39:29.320
(That new Banner Commander Zhao)

00:39:29.400 --> 00:39:30.599
(can refine cliff salt.)

00:39:30.599 --> 00:39:31.679
(He'll steal our business sooner or later.)

00:39:31.679 --> 00:39:32.360
Guys,

00:39:32.480 --> 00:39:33.320
Get him!

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:34.039
Let's go!

00:39:34.039 --> 00:39:34.920
Catch them!

00:39:39.639 --> 00:39:42.320
(Banner Commander Zhao has been held by bandits for seven days.)

00:39:42.800 --> 00:39:43.880
(By custom,)

00:39:44.480 --> 00:39:45.960
(he is to be declared dead in the line of duty.)

00:39:46.800 --> 00:39:48.559
(The Admonitions for Women Hall has prepared)

00:39:48.559 --> 00:39:50.039
(Admonitions for Women) (a fine quarter for you.)

00:39:50.400 --> 00:39:51.360
(Ms. Zuo)

00:39:51.800 --> 00:39:53.559
(will guide you properly.)

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:56.199
(Do you know what the Chastity Tonic is?)

00:39:56.679 --> 00:39:57.760
(Drink it,)

00:39:58.440 --> 00:40:00.800
(and your skin will decay,)

00:40:01.440 --> 00:40:03.119
(your hair will turn white,)

00:40:04.320 --> 00:40:06.079
(and you'll never bear children.)

00:40:20.000 --> 00:40:24.320
♪The past brushes by like a falling leaf♪

00:40:27.920 --> 00:40:32.280
♪So light, yet my steps still pause for you♪

00:40:34.400 --> 00:40:39.040
♪Through every rise and fall, our memories remain without regret♪

00:40:39.280 --> 00:40:42.080
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

00:40:43.240 --> 00:40:47.880
♪How I wish I could stay a little longer, but I can't♪

00:40:51.080 --> 00:40:57.920
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill my eyes with tears♪

00:40:58.800 --> 00:41:05.320
♪Etched deep within my heart, yet buried without a word♪

00:41:06.280 --> 00:41:09.720
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:41:10.240 --> 00:41:14.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:41:14.720 --> 00:41:20.400
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

00:41:32.520 --> 00:41:36.400
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you in the crowd♪

00:41:40.320 --> 00:41:44.320
♪Without a word, you lit up half my life♪

00:41:46.040 --> 00:41:50.720
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

00:41:51.040 --> 00:41:53.720
♪Kept close within my heart♪

00:41:54.800 --> 00:41:59.640
♪From now on, no one else is worth waiting for♪

00:42:03.160 --> 00:42:10.080
♪I turn away, afraid no one will ever come home to me again♪

00:42:10.960 --> 00:42:17.440
♪If we can build our future together, no storm can chill my heart♪

00:42:18.320 --> 00:42:21.840
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:42:22.280 --> 00:42:26.640
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:42:26.840 --> 00:42:32.560
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

